/*!
  \page example_cxx_neighbor_search Neighbor searches with kd-trees and k-NN graphs

  This example builds a Ponca::KdTreeDense and a Ponca::KdTreeSparse (over half of the points) from a random point
  cloud, and a Ponca::KnnGraph from the dense tree. It then performs nearest, k-nearest and range searches, from point
  indices and from arbitrary positions, and shows how to reuse query objects.

  Build and run:
  \code{.sh}
  cmake --build build --target ponca_neighbor_search
  ./build/examples/cpp/ponca_neighbor_search
  \endcode

  See also \ref spatialpartitioning.

  \include cpp/ponca_neighbor_search.cpp
*/
